[Error  :XUnity.AutoTranslator] Failed: '【Update】
Updated new dialogue UI.
Adjusted the collider of Frost Ring.
Assisting NPCs will now rest away from traps after combat.
【Bug Fixes】
Fixed an issue where the controller key remapping function was not working properly.
Fixed an issue where perfect parry damage was abnormal when using Cold Light Refraction.
Fixed an issue where some skills would lose damage after attack speed exceeded a certain threshold.
Fixed an issue where upgrading the Piggy Bank was not working.
Fixed an issue where the HP of the Heart-Piercing Executioner was abnormal.
Fixed an issue where Spread didn't work on the Cannon.
Fixed an issue where there was no damage immunity during resurrection.
Fixed an issue where the player wouldn't close their eyes during the Erosion animation.
Fixed an issue where selecting a Skill when all active skills were maxed would briefly display a two-choice screen.'
